        "created_at": "2014-08-25T14:15:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, we had a situation come up in a recent game, and I wondered if there was an official ruling. We were having a rough game, and were down to only one active hero. One of the villians targeted the hero with the second lowest HP. Since there was only one hero left, there was not a hero available with the second lowest HP. Would the attack fizzle in this case, or would it hit the one active hero?</p>",
