      {
        "id": 116086,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-25T18:01:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree that if there's only one hero in the game then there is no second-lowest hero to take the damage.&nbsp; This would (IMO) be just like KNYFE's \"Infiltrate and Obfuscate\", which redirects damage to the villain target with the second-highest hp.&nbsp; It's been officially ruled that if there is not a villain target with the second-highest hp (i.e. there's only one villain target in the game), then the redirection can't happen.</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/comment/56321#comment-56321</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:26.164Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
