        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I agree that if there&#39;s only one hero in the game then there is no second-lowest hero to take the damage.&nbsp; This would (IMO) be just like KNYFE&#39;s &quot;Infiltrate and Obfuscate&quot;, which redirects damage to the villain target with the second-highest hp.&nbsp; It&#39;s been officially ruled that if there is not a villain target with the second-highest hp (i.e. there&#39;s only one villain target in the game), then the redirection can&#39;t happen.</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/comment/56321#comment-56321</p>",
